To Compile a code and build a jar file using - mvn clean package  command 

mvn clean package - this is a command to create a jar file in java build

archieve artifacts 

archieveArtifacts artifacts: "**/target/*.war"

** - means workspace directory
target - it's exists inside workspace directory


To use parameters inside pipeline stage use below syntax 

pipeline{
agent any
parameters {
string defaultValue: 'gupta', name: "LASTNAME"
}
environment{
  NAME = "Rahul"
}
stages{
   stage('Build'){
     echo "$NAME ${params.LASTNAME}"
   }
}
}


To write the build output artifact in workspace for later use
writeFile file: "output/usefulfile.txt", text: "This file is useful, need to archive it."
